config GMK70_BATTERY
    bool "GMK70 stock radio percentage and charger-status inputs"
    depends on BOARD_GMK70_WIRED && GMK70_ZMK_STUDIO_SETTINGS
    select ZMK_BATTERY_REPORTING
    help
      Opt-in Studio integration. Only the physical LEFT initializes UART3.
      Poll the unchanged stock radio with its battery inquiry and ACK messages;
      expose fresh percentages through the native state-of-charge sensor.
      A7 and A15 provide cable and hardware full-status indications.
      This does not implement a wireless keyboard endpoint or voltage reading.
